SUMMARY:My ’90s Rock Photographs
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:Melissa Auf der Maur\nAn intimate conversation with alt-rock ba
 ssist Melissa Auf der Maur — of Hole and Smashing Pumpkins fame — as s
 he walks us through Even the Good Girls Will Cry: A ’90s Rock Memoir (Da
  Capo) and shares images from Melissa Auf der Maur: My ’90s Rock Photogr
 aphs (DelMonico Books)\, the catalog to her exhibition at Art Gallery of O
 ntario that doubles as a photographic love letter to the last analog decad
 e.\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/my-90s-rock-photographsmelissa-auf-der-maur
 /\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/my-90s-rock-photographsmelissa-auf-der-maur/
