SUMMARY:Laurent Grasso
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:Metaphysical Maze\nMetaphysical Maze will be the largest exhibi
 tion to date in the United States devoted to French conceptual artist Laur
 ent Grasso. Installed in the museum’s iconic Building 5\, Metaphysical M
 aze will take the form of an immersive installation bringing together\, fo
 r the first time\, the artist’s most emblematic films\, along with a new
  commission in progress\, Cosmic Drive\, produced during his research resi
 dency at the SETI Institute in Mountain View\, California.\nhttps://massmo
 ca.org/event/laurent-grasso-metaphysical-maze/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass:
  https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/laurent-grasso-metaphysical-maze/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ee4063f2ff69f50858b49f3ba6368f20bf2a37be@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261011T010050Z
DTSTART:20261107T210000Z
DTEND:20261107T230000Z
SUMMARY:In Conversation: Laurent Grasso
LOCATION:Mass MoCA\, 1040 Mass MoCA Way\, North Adams\, MA 01247
DESCRIPTION:In Laurent Grasso’s universe\, all lines are blurred\; within
  his exhibition\, time appears suspended\, with film\, paintings\, and arc
 hitectural interventions encroaching upon a visitor’s perception of line
 arity. Together\, these presentations will bring past and present into con
 versation\, placing Grasso’s work in a dialogue with historical figures 
 of American landscape painting.\nhttps://massmoca.org/event/in-conversatio
 n-laurent-grasso/\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/western
 ma/
URL:https://massmoca.org/event/in-conversation-laurent-grasso/
END:VEVENT
